	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c04r0801_baseballm_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>レッツ　トレーニング！▼
これを　ポケモンに　もたせて
さあ　からだを　いじめよう！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-18T06:44:34" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>レッツ　トレーニング！▼
これを　ポケモンに　持たせて
さあ　身体を　いじめよう！！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-18T06:44:53" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂
・アイテム入手処理
　No215「きょうせいギプス」
※swanでメッセージ修正</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-18T06:45:04" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BASEBALLM</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:11" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
