	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c04r0801_list_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>きみ　せいそくちリストを
うめていそうな　タイプだな▼
ねえ　１６ばんどうろには　どんな
ポケモンが　いるのか　おしえてよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T02:06:08" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T07:22:47" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>きみ　生息地リストを
埋めていそうな　タイプだな▼
ねえ　１６番道路には　どんな
ポケモンが　いるのか　教えてよ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T03:05:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T07:22:47" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：せいそくちリスト
・対象マップが
　埋まっている　→list_02
　埋まっていない→list_03</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T03:14:43" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BASKETM</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T03:15:36" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#404040</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c04r0801_list_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ああ……　まだ
しらべている　とちゅう　なんだ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T03:05:24" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T07:22:47" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ああ……　まだ
調べている　途中　なんだ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T03:05:19" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T07:22:47" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：せいそくちリスト
・埋まってない</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T03:14:44" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>BASKETM</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T03:15:38" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#404040</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
				Time="0001-01-01T00:00:00" />
		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c04r0801_list_03"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>へえ！　すごいね！▼
いいものを　みせてくれたから
プレゼント　しちゃうよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T02:14:40" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T07:22:47" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>へえ！　すごいね！▼
いいものを　みせてくれたから
プレゼント　しちゃうよ！▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T02:14:42" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
