	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c04r0801_list_04"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>せいそくちリストの　きのうを
つくった　ひとって　よっぽど▽
ポケモンと　であってほしいんだね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T03:14:20" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T07:22:47" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>生息地リストの　機能を
追加した　人って　よっぽど▽
ポケモンと　出会ってほしいんだね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T03:14:19" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-12T07:22:47" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♂：せいそくちリスト
・アイテム入手後</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-11-13T03:14:46" />
		</CommentCell>
